From bc1f5815cb47148c7489cfcd7dc35c2aa9d7859d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luuk van Dijk <lvd@mndmttr.net>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 07:03:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(bmp388): split the bus interface out, add SPI

The driver was I2C-only with the bus calls inlined. Factor the
in-tree interface pattern out (bmp388_i2c.cpp) and add an SPI
interface (bmp388_spi.cpp): SPI reads are 0x80|reg followed by one
dummy byte before data, per the BMP388/BMP390 datasheet interface
description. No behavior change on I2C.
---
